        "table": null,
        "text": "•Revenues were $402.8 billion, an increase of 15% year over year, primarily driven by an increase in Google Services revenues of $37.8 billion, or 12%, and an increase in Google Cloud revenues of $15.5 billion, or 36%.",
        "text_hash": "7f1a28ce5e09237b2ee03978a23aadb2619ff0e24a60341c630d4c54c99468e3",
        "type": "list_item"
      },
      {
