          "padding-left": "36pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-18pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "•Operating expenses were $111.3 billion, an increase of 22% year over year, primarily driven by increases in employee compensation expenses, expenses related to legal and other matters, and depreciation expense.",
